    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA aba Bokimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA ghang'eada Gilgali ea ghwahita Bokimu. Ak gwayeesha, “Gearuunaneegwa Misri, nea geayeaneegwa jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi eayeaksi habeawooda gideaba gaydaadaw ghweanigeagwa. Nea geayeenyi, ‘Maygudu dayam neajeedeanyu sea agooga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ea majasna neajeeda sea fuga bea ng'eanyiida, gajoohiing'siina ng'eanyi heeda nyaawa wagiida.’ Ak agooga ea miyoosisiina mureeda digheandeanyu. Ng'asheanji oosinyiin naaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa geayeenyi, maydahoan gwariteawa madeedeang'wa. Ak hean nea gayghoah halaghweenga aba badahuukeagwa, nea aseecheeka nyaawa gayghoah gichea ghaghaseegwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwarukusa ng'asheesu heeda fuga sean bea Israeli, gagatkat buuneeda ghuusiga nyaawa ak gooyeawda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguura gheawungeaba hoowa Bokimu; ak gwasissa NG'UTAMIIDA lukghumajeega aba hoowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Yoshuwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghoadaarda Yoshuwa buuneeda, gaweay fuga Israeli ak gaba nih weah headaanyi bea hearaniischooda goombal ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagadiiyeesa buuneeda NG'UTAMIIDA eawoojiga sean bea Yoshuwa, ea eawoojiga sean bea gweargwa aghiis heeda Yoshuwa, fuga ghayi nidaah gadiyeeda haw ghayi nisissa NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yoshuwa orjeeda Nuni, was siida gadiyeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ghami nea gaba gweanyeew bughala ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geebung'sa jeeda moonghooda bea hearaniischoadaanyi aba Dimnat-heresi aba jeeda ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, was wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa bea giijeeda Gashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea seaygoojigiga seaniin geemuguushsa heeda ghweaniga nyaawa; ak ghang'eat seayga nuut aba badayda nyaawa, gea mwanala NG'UTAMIIDA ghana gadiyeeda ghayi nisissa fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli ghwanung'waada badita NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin fuga Israeli ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gagadiiyeesa Baali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwanung'waada NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa, ghayi aruuna saawa ng'eanyiida Misri; aba eadita geeshta aseecheeka suuk; aba jeeda aseecheeka fuga ascheayi saawa, nea gwahiing'sa geat; ak ghwanung' ghwanyareas NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung'wa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gaweay gagadiiyeesa Baali ea Ashtaroti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'waaniit nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda fuga Israeli, ak ghwaahaak saawa geatinga fuga ang'oonyi fih, ak geenung' ghoah giing'oonyanga; hean ghwashaayda ak ghwayiin geatinga weajoodiga nyaawa mida bugusta nyaawa, gideaba ea mudu ghoamu ghamiinaada aba madeeda weajoodiga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinyo gaweay, inyeesa geatinda NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda badayda nyaawa aba munyinda, gawuurji gidaghayi rukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea gidaghayi aksiinda saawa NG'UTAMIIDA habeawooda; hean ng'ata ghang'eat giiseaneega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gagatkat NG'UTAMIIDA fuga laja girgweaguutka, lealna saawa geatinga fuga ghayi nung' ghoah saawa giing'oonyanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nea ea mooleeysiina iit fuga nyaawa laja girgweaguutka nea masina aba eadita geeshta aseecheeka suuk inyeesa gwahiing'sa geat saawa; ak ghwalamwach gwayamna geat naweeda ghayi aat ghweaniga nyaawa, ghayi sissa mureeda digheanyeeka NG'UTAMIIDA, nea saawa ea mahindunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA Iinyo gagatkat siida laja girgweaguutka aba badayda nyaawa, NG'UTAMIIDA inyeesa gwandeayi sea siida laja girgweaguutka, ak gwalealna geatinga weajoodiga nyaawa eawoojiga sean bea siida laja girgweaguutka; aba gideaba ghabwayda NG'UTAMIIDA aba sawanaduutka nyaawa leabu heeda fugiga sawan nea ghaghabwasiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ng'ata nea ghami siida laja girgweaguutka, gabiikta bwadaw ak gwasin munyasnacheeka naawa gea ghweaniga nyaawa, aba eadita geeshta aseecheeka suuk, ak gagadiiyeesa nea inyeesa gwahiing'sa geat; ak ea moabuuda naweadinga nyaawa munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'waaniit nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda fuga Israeli; ak gwayi, “Aba gideaba fiisu nidatas neajeedeanyu ghayi aadawji ghweaniga nyaawa, ak ea mooleeysiina iita ghuuteanyu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak aniini ea maydearuuteawa madeeda nyaawa eara eemeanagi aba bugusta eemoojiga ghayi nung'wa heeda Yoshuwa damanda meawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak aba ng'asheesu gaydagatgat fuga Israeli dadaah ea jea ghwaat geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA aba mureeda gawuurji gidaghayi sin ghweaniga nyaawa, ghana maygwasin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung'waada NG'UTAMIIDA eemoojisu, nea mahoana gaweay aba damandida, nea mwayiina geatinga Yoshuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
